[ar:The Larping Tombstone]
[ti:Looping the Rooms (Larping the Rooms) (Remix) - English]
[length:02:30.00]
[by:The Larping Tombstone - Lyriced by Max Realm]

[00:20.81]Pull out the cassette
[00:24.34]Press down the reset
[00:27.04]Wander into a maze
[00:30.05]I press on, only to hit dal segno

[00:32.30]Beyond the door, I saw my own back
[00:35.55]When I turned around, I saw hope up ahead
[00:38.54]Where could the end of hell possibly be?
[00:41.57]Is there still no exit?

[00:44.66]Round and round and round and round
[00:46.24]Repeat, repeat
[00:48.25]Repeat, repeat
[00:50.30]Swaying, swaying, swaying, swaying
[00:51.90]Fractal, fractal
[00:53.97]Fractal, fractal

[01:09.05]Thoughts spinning in vain
[01:12.02]An endless road
[01:14.98]Oxygen that reeks of iron
[01:18.38]An SOS that never gets through

[01:20.57]I staved off hunger with a pomegranate I found
[01:23.15]A ringing started from inside my skull
[01:26.22]If nothing changes no matter how far I go
[01:29.53]Then what meaning is there in resisting?

[01:37.82]Round and round and round and round
[01:39.44]Repeat, repeat
[01:41.47]Repeat, repeat
[01:43.47]Swaying, swaying, swaying, swaying
[01:45.27]Fractal, fractal
[01:47.39]Fractal, fractal

[01:49.64]Ah, open the door
[01:51.57]Forget even the meaning
[01:53.44]Into the depths of a broken dream
[01:55.63]It goes on forever and ever
[01:59.85]Round and round, repeating
